# MT6858 kernel, one for every board on the SoC: mainline at 4dce97c6c
# (after v7.4-rc4) with the MT6858 series below, built from arm64 defconfig,
# the series' mt6858.config and marathon.config. The patches are
# git format-patch 4dce97c6c..eaf46753f of the jp2601/initial branch
# (devices/jolla/jp2601/BRINGUP.md says what each one is).
